{"4319910": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Campfire: Night One", "steam_appid": 4319910, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4319910/extras/a3149e8b1a30bb68107f3a0294d78cbe.avif?t=1788273699\" width=1270 height=626 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>&quot;Do monsters walk among us, or do they live within us?&quot;</strong></i> <br><br>The Abanda wilderness never forgets. For centuries, the walls of Lockwood Castle have guarded a secret that locals only dare to whisper. They say the fortress was built to protect humanity from what dwells in the dark—but what if the line between safety and damnation blurred long ago? Sarah wakes up alone beneath the trees, where the silence carries weight and the shadows possess a will of their own. What began as a university rite of passage has become the dawn of an ancient truth. The darkness does not only hide within the thickets; it lingers in the abandoned walls, in betrayed trust, and in every beating heart. <br><br><i><strong>In this night, death is not the greatest fear. It is the realization of who you should truly be afraid of.</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Experience True Survival Horror</strong> Campfire: Night One is an immersive psychological horror game where every shadow hides a threat and every bullet counts. As you navigate the oppressive darkness of the Abanda wilderness, you must do more than just survive—you must find and rescue the one who matters most to you.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Survival:</strong> Use your flashlight wisely to navigate, but remember: light attracts what dwells in the dark.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental Puzzles:</strong> Solve logical challenges and environmental puzzles within the abandoned walls of Lockwood Castle to uncover the truth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escort and Protect:</strong> You are not alone. Assist and guide your companion through the wilderness, ensuring their safety as you make your way toward sanctuary.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stealth and Hiding:</strong> When the killer is nearby, fighting isn't always an option. Hide in restrooms or cabinets to evade a gruesome fate.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Terror:</strong> A deep, psychological experience where the line between reality and nightmare blurs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Supernatural Creatures:</strong> Humans aren't the only thing you should fear! Within and outside the walls of Lockwood Castle, multiple creatures lurk in the dark, waiting for you.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4319910/extras/a3149e8b1a30bb68107f3a0294d78cbe.avif?t=1788273699\" width=1270 height=626 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>&quot;Do monsters walk among us, or do they live within us?&quot;</strong></i> <br><br>The Abanda wilderness never forgets. For centuries, the walls of Lockwood Castle have guarded a secret that locals only dare to whisper. They say the fortress was built to protect humanity from what dwells in the dark—but what if the line between safety and damnation blurred long ago? Sarah wakes up alone beneath the trees, where the silence carries weight and the shadows possess a will of their own. What began as a university rite of passage has become the dawn of an ancient truth. The darkness does not only hide withi